<title>SINGAPORE: Nakornthon Bank signs US$100 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Nakornthon Bank signs US$100 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nakornthon Bank signed a US100 million Floating Rate Certificates of Deposit issue on Monday, according to Bayerische Landesbank, one of 17 financial institutions and banks involved in the issue.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the issue was for five years with call and put options at the end of the third year from the desposit date,</p>
<p>The issue, first announced in Hong Kong in July, carries an interest margin of 0.50 per cent per annum over six-month London Interbank Offered Rate (LIBOR).</p>
<p>-Singapore newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
